* German Trio preamp, stage 5 of 5: the V4A cathode follower, the effects loop (send and return normalled), V4B, the DEEP network and the two
* master volumes. The Clean channel arrives from stage 2 (node cw, link source VCV), Crunch and Lead from stage 4 (node vw, VVW); the
* switch resistors SW_M4C / SW_M4X pick which one is connected (the relays CL, CR, LE).
*
* V4A: grid behind 100n, 1M back to the tap between its 1k82 and a 10k to ground; the plate through 100k from the V4 rail. The send is
* taken from the cathode (1u + 100n). With nothing in the return jack both legs of the return network are fed from that node: 100k each
* into the 100kB pot (its wiper to ground, half each side at 50k here) and 100k from each end to V4B's grid.
* V4B: 100k plate load (265 V), 1k82 + 100n cathode, 10n coupling. After it: 100k || 220p from the coupling to the master pots' input, 100k
* of which also sees the DEEP network (10n + 47k5 to ground, with the 500kA pot in parallel with the 10n), then MA1 and MA2 (1MB) whose
* wipers go through the relays MA1 / MA2 to the output (node pa) with its 1M to ground.

V VRAIL x 100 380
S VCV cw 1 0
S VVW vw 1 0
R SW_M4C cw m4 1
R SW_M4X vw m4 1e12
R R1M4 m4 0 1M
C C100n m4 g4a 100n
T V4A g4a p4a k4a 12AX7
R R4A x p4a 100k
R RK4A k4a n4k 1k82
R R10K n4k 0 10k
R R1MK g4a n4k 1M
C C1u k4a lp 1u
C C100s k4a lp 100n

* Effects loop (nothing plugged in): both legs from the send.
R RL1 lp la 100k
R RL2 lp lb 100k
R RPa la pw 50k
R RPb lb pw 50k
R RPg pw 0 1
R RG1 la g4b 100k
R RG2 lb g4b 100k
T V4B g4b p4b k4b 12AX7
R R4B x p4b 100k
R RK4B k4b 0 1k82
C CK4B k4b 0 100n

* After V4B.
C C10n p4b m0 10n
R RM100 m0 s1 100k
C CM220 m0 s1 220p
R R47k5 e 0 47k5
C CD10 s1 e 10n
R VRDEEP s1 e 1
R VRMA1_T s1 w1 1
R VRMA1_B w1 0 1
R VRMA2_T s1 w2 1
R VRMA2_B w2 0 1
R SW_MA1 w1 pa 1
R SW_MA2 w2 pa 1e12
R R1MPA pa 0 1M
